                    "B": "1080",
                    "C": "1008",
                    "D": "1800",
                    "E": "None of these"
                },
                "correct_option": "C",
                "explanation": "? = (4 × 189) + (2 × 126) = 756 + 252 = 1008. Hence, option C is correct."
            },
            {
                "question_id": 2,
                "question": "9(3/7) + 6(4/7) - ? = 14(4/7)",
                "options": {
                    "A": "3/7",
                    "B": "4/7",
                    "C": "2(4/7)",
                    "D": "1(3/7)",
                    "E": "None of these"
                },
                "correct_option": "D",
                "explanation": "? = 9 + 3/7 + 6 + 4/7 - 14 - 4/7 = 1 + 3/7 = 1(3/7). Hence, option D is correct."
            }
        ]
